#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Traefik Manager cannot edit {names}, because another provider such as Docker "
"labels defines it. It stops working until you remove the middleware there."
msgid_plural ""
"Traefik Manager cannot edit {names}, because another provider such as Docker "
"labels defines them. They stop working until you remove the middleware there."
msgstr[0] ""

msgid ""
"Traefik Manager cannot read its configuration file, so it cannot tell "
"whether this is a new install. Setup is disabled until the file is fixed or "
"restored from a backup. See the container log for the path and the reason."
msgstr ""
"Traefik Manager가 구성 파일을 읽을 수 없어 새 설치인지 판단할 수 없습니다. 파"
